# Vercel rootDirectory is set to `web/` in the project dashboard (Phase 3).
# This .vercelignore is defensive — exclude every non-Next.js path from any
# context the build might still see. Do NOT exclude `web/`.
#
# These are root-only paths, so each MUST carry a leading slash to anchor it to
# the repo root. An unanchored `api/` is a gitignore-style match-at-any-depth
# pattern and silently strips `web/app/api/` too — which dropped the /api/find
# route handler from the build (it 404'd in prod while every other route built).
/api/
/.doey/
/.claude/
/.githooks/
/.github/
/apps/
/docs/
/priv/
/deps/
/_build/

# Phoenix / Elixir
*.ex
*.exs
*.beam

# Go TUI
*.go
go.mod
go.sum

# Build / runtime artifacts not relevant to Next
Makefile
deploy.sh
docker-compose.yml
Dockerfile
*.lock
